# ==========================================================================
#  Job map steps: the steps of each job, in the job executor's words
#  Target named graph: <https://www.insperity.com/graph/outcome-benchmark/job-map-steps>
#  189 individuals of jtbd:job-map-step (a core:job-step), one or more per job.
#  Each step is unique to its job (decision 17), placed on one universal job map stage,
#  ordered with core:precedes, and carries the desired outcomes judged in it (core:hasOutcome).
#  Steps and outcomes are intentionally not one-to-one; a stage with no outcomes has no step.
#  Load after: 00-jobs-to-be-done-ontology.ttl, 01-job-steps.ttl (job map stages),
#              05/06/11 vocabularies, and Baseline Core v1.0 (ontology-core, shapes-core).
#  Source: PEO Outcome Benchmark (Outcome-Driven Innovation study blueprint)
#  Status: Draft 0.4.0, generated 2026-10-26, pending business and compliance SME review
# ==========================================================================

